=== PARITY / IMPLEMENTATION SUMMARY ===
Web source : web/src/features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/TemperatureGauges.tsx (THE spec).
Native out : apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/TemperatureGauges.cs + .Model.cs
             (presentational + prop; mirrors the BatteryHealthSection 2-file pattern).
Data       : web useTranslation -> ILocalizer facade (P1/S10); web useUnits -> UnitPref (P1/S8 seam,
             carried on the model; view exposes a Units setter that re-projects). No HTTP in the view.
Shared map : @/components/ui GlassPanel -> TsGlassPanel; @/components/layout Grid -> TsGrid;
             @/components/motion FadeIn -> TsFadeIn; @/components/charts/RadialGauge -> per-gauge arc drawn
             from the shared ChartGeometry.RingArc + ChartShapes.ArcPath + ChartBrushes (TsRadialGauge has
             no semantic-status colour input, so the value arc is composed from the same primitives it uses);
